{'symbol': 'EXC', 'date': '2022-05-17 10:00:00', 'title': "COMED TO TRAIN, HIRE 180 NEW ENTRY-LEVEL EMPLOYEES IN 2022 TO MEET DEMANDS OF ILLINOIS' CLEAN ENERGY TRANSFORMATION", 'text': "CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ILLINOIS' CLEAN ENERGY TRANSFORMATION REQUIRES A HIGHLY TRAINED ENERGY WORKFORCE, AND COMED IS INVESTING TO EXPAND APPRENTICESHIP PATHWAYS AND TO RECRUIT MORE DIVERSE, LOCAL TALENT TO MEET FUTURE DEMAND. TO PREPARE FOR CLEAN ENERGY GROWTH AND ELECTRIFICATION OF TRANSPORTATION AND OTHER SECTORS, COMED TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT WILL HIRE 180 NEW ENTRY-LEVEL EMPLOYEES IN 2022 AND FILL 500 ENTRY-LEVEL ROLES IN THE NEXT THREE YEARS. ON MAY 23, COMED WILL BEGIN THE NEXT PHASE"}